 h264 as it was in hevc that's patented and not supported on open source browsers like Firefox/Chromium.\n\nI didn't know that, i'll make sure to use h264 next time.\n\nI dont think the `RENDER_GRAPH_REORDER = 0` has any culprit in this case as this is just to avoid other crash and works in 4.4 dev 2, is just my phone GPU that hates Vulkan for some reason.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2649031307/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2691594396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102635#issuecomment-2691594396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102635","id":2691594396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gbnic","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-28T21:41:56Z","updated_at":"2025-02-28T21:41:56Z","body":"Does the PR to disable `RENDE